    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sculpt sand to create winding streams through lush forests and rolling meadows. Babbling Brook is a relaxing indie game about messing around with water and sand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Also, there's a flock of rubber ducks trying to escape to the open sea...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/09aad828119c9c26982ec30efe2ac686.poster.avif?t=1754136839\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/09aad828119c9c26982ec30efe2ac686.webm?t=1754136839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/09aad828119c9c26982ec30efe2ac686.mp4?t=1754136839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, interactive water physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig &amp; pile up sand to make streams, puddles and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple relaxing, low-pressure game-modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy &amp; simple controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/f7976194d6110048a8de903f6feca2d2.poster.avif?t=1754136839\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/f7976194d6110048a8de903f6feca2d2.webm?t=1754136839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/f7976194d6110048a8de903f6feca2d2.mp4?t=1754136839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now play the demo of Babbling Brook, which includes a couple of levels and game modes for you to try out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/9335c5835eaad48daf1d1ecad9b96930.poster.avif?t=1754136839\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/9335c5835eaad48daf1d1ecad9b96930.webm?t=1754136839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672300/extras/9335c5835eaad48daf1d1ecad9b96930.mp4?t=1754136839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist on Steam</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to wishlist Babbling Brook on Steam. So that you'll be notified when the full game is out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
